 "decision": "other",
 "reason": "do-not-land. G1 NOT_MET both: aisha fill far-eye yaw40-L-out 0.0201 (8/399px, bg 0.36) vs frontal 0.6066, yaw-40-R-out 0.0 vs 0.5386; body2 0.0256 (1/39px, bg 0.92) vs 0.4164, 0.0 vs 0.5161. land fails: aisha yaw40-L-out fill 0.0201 < base 0.0251 (10/399px), noise 0. drop fails: bases far below frontal and 6/8 yaw-outer cells change by >0. rework triggers absent: G2 union 0 both (band 2/3px on-seam), CW3 -0.005/-0.0049, CW1 >=0.986/0.993, no float in 400px crops or blink. Grazing far-eye sixths are 36-94% background past the silhouette (perspective collapse, same mechanism as eye3): body2 gains 0->1px far-eye and +6/+14px near-eye do not justify landing with an Aisha far-eye regression. Fill stays store-only; parameterised cross-subject tools stay."
